message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the software version and commit or
  archive identity used. See CITATION.md for citation guidance and the scope
  of the supplied evidence.
type: software
title: KAHM forecasting demonstrator
authors:
  - given-names: Mohit
    family-names: Kumar
version: 0.1.1
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/MohitKumarRostock/certified-kahm-representations-forecasting
abstract: >-
  A self-contained demonstration of geometry-induced KAHM soft-state
  representations for scalar forecasting, with frozen computational
  predictors, conditional fitted-risk upper certificates, and an exact
  finite-benchmark population audit.
keywords:
  - KAHM
  - forecasting
  - representation learning
  - risk certification
  - reproducibility
